From 0a4aeecb80418ae9b008401ba9e57c0cd046d8a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 03:23:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/39] fix: success rate 0%, payout badge count, streak bonus
 label in daily mode

- Success Rate: daily mode was using multiSummary.successRate (built from
  campaignPlayerLevels which is empty for daily campaigns); now always uses
  achieved.length / players.length in daily mode
- Payout tab badge: daily+multi-level was using multiPayoutRows.length (0);
  now uses dailyAchieved.length so badge shows correct daily qualifier count
- Streak Bonus Summary: type check was 'percentage' but stored value is 'pct',
  causing "RM 0 per streak" label; fixed to match stored enum value

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DqGp4gVeTBMvwho4pP8n8C
---
 src/pages/Campaigns.jsx | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/pages/Campaigns.jsx b/src/pages/Campaigns.jsx
index 7af4500..932991a 100644
